        "original_id": "b2c47308-beed-51f5-b0b5-2fd75a6eea7d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francesca Annis, Prince, Jerome Benton, Steven Berkoff, Kristin Scott Thomas\n- Works: Under the Cherry Moon, Lillie\n- Organizations: BAFTA TV Awards, ITV\n\nFacts:\n- In 1979, Francesca Annis won the BAFTA TV Award for Best Actress for the ITV serial \"Lillie\".\n- Francesca Annis was a six-time BAFTA TV Award nominee.\n- The film \"Under the Cherry Moon\" stars Prince, former The Time member Jerome Benton, Steven Berkoff, Kristin Scott Thomas in her feature film debut, and Francesca Annis.",
